cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or this pipeline in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DEBTraits-NER: annotated corpus and construction pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An annotated corpus for named-entity recognition of Dynamic Energy Budget
  (DEB) life-history traits, generated from the Add-my-Pet (AmP) database:
  7,281 species, 54 taxonomic classes, ten DEB models, 191,337 sentences and
  119,530 annotated mentions of 20 traits, with species-disjoint training,
  validation and test splits. The release also contains the AmP source
  records, the life cycles and lexica, and the notebooks, scripts and prompts
  used to generate and verify the corpus.
type: dataset
